to pull the trigger.


01:17:50.756 --> 01:17:52.925
Oh, no, no, no.
I'm a Christian.


01:17:52.958 --> 01:17:54.893
Besides, Girder says
it has to be you.


01:17:54.927 --> 01:17:56.861
Distraught killer
can't live with the guilt.


01:17:56.895 --> 01:17:59.330
Something public.
No questions. Look, I'm...


01:18:00.565 --> 01:18:02.567
I'm just here to fix your head.


01:18:04.302 --> 01:18:06.971
It's just that I don't have
complete control right now.


01:18:07.004 --> 01:18:09.040
That's why I'm here.


01:18:09.073 --> 01:18:12.276
Come on.
We don't have much time.


01:18:16.981 --> 01:18:18.883
All right. There you go.


01:18:24.288 --> 01:18:25.858
Yeah.


01:18:25.890 --> 01:18:27.425
OK.


01:18:27.458 --> 01:18:30.829
There you go. Just booting up.


01:18:30.863 --> 01:18:32.731
I'm gonna check your sync first.


01:18:32.765 --> 01:18:35.768
You'll see a series of images.


01:18:35.801 --> 01:18:39.002
Just look at them
and answer my questions.


01:18:40.003 --> 01:18:42.473
Do you see a fox or a bird?


01:18:43.709 --> 01:18:45.208
Fox.


01:18:45.242 --> 01:18:48.346
- Fish or snake?
- Fish.


01:18:49.981 --> 01:18:53.719
- Mouse or a dog?
- Mouse.


01:18:53.752 --> 01:18:59.122
Good, good. You're seeing all
the right animals, as they say.


01:18:59.156 --> 01:19:03.796
Now, I'm going to do
a pulse analysis.


01:19:03.829 --> 01:19:05.061
You might find this
uncomfortable,


01:19:05.095 --> 01:19:08.265
but you just need to try
to keep breathing.


01:19:08.298 --> 01:19:09.600
Ready?


01:21:52.661 --> 01:21:54.263
Oh, God!


01:21:55.732 --> 01:21:57.266
Eddie.


01:21:58.467 --> 01:22:00.102
Eddie.


01:22:01.503 --> 01:22:03.405
Eddie. Oh!


01:22:03.941 --> 01:22:05.307
Oh, fuck.


01:22:06.442 --> 01:22:07.711
Oh, fuck.


01:22:08.878 --> 01:22:10.915
No, no, no. Fuck!


01:22:12.983 --> 01:22:14.298
Oh, fuck!


01:22:14.550 --> 01:22:17.486
Oh, fuck!


01:22:32.434 --> 01:22:33.903
Oh, shit.


01:23:07.201 --> 01:23:09.371
Oh, fuck. Oh, fuck.


01:23:12.809 --> 01:23:14.375
You bitch.


01:23:21.116 --> 01:23:23.485
You want a shot? Do it.


01:23:24.352 --> 01:23:27.392
Do it! Do it! Do it!


01:23:27.791 --> 01:23:30.694
Do it! Do it! Do it!


01:23:30.727 --> 01:23:32.226
Do it!


01:23:57.652 --> 01:23:59.520
You missed.


01:24:16.872 --> 01:24:18.707
Hi, darling.


01:24:21.744 --> 01:24:23.578
Darling.


01:24:25.513 --> 01:24:27.248
Darling.


01:24:35.824 --> 01:24:37.625
Hi, darling.


01:24:41.062 --> 01:24:42.731
Darling.


01:24:45.801 --> 01:24:47.468
Hi, darling.


01:24:52.975 --> 01:24:54.509
Michael.


01:25:21.937 --> 01:25:23.739
Hello, Michael.


01:25:26.073 --> 01:25:28.441
I'm absolutely starving.


01:25:32.881 --> 01:25:34.682
I'm starving.


01:26:10.051 --> 01:26:11.854
- Hello.
- Hi.


01:26:14.021 --> 01:26:16.123
- What you got there?
- A map.


01:26:17.490 --> 01:26:19.492
What's it a map of?


01:26:19.526 --> 01:26:23.530
It goes to the pond.
I discovered it yesterday.


01:26:23.563 --> 01:26:24.598
Oh.


01:26:26.399 --> 01:26:30.171
- What's your name?
- I'm Ira.


01:26:30.204 --> 01:26:31.571
Ira.


01:26:34.242 --> 01:26:36.077
I think I know you
from somewhere.


01:26:40.580 --> 01:26:42.884
Is that your house over there?


01:26:45.186 --> 01:26:47.420
- Ira!
- Uh-oh.


01:26:54.161 --> 01:26:55.595
Yeah.


01:27:39.172 --> 01:27:40.942
Michael?


01:27:41.675 --> 01:27:42.910
Yes.


01:27:44.010 --> 01:27:47.347
Uh, hi, I'm a friend
of your wife's.


01:27:47.380 --> 01:27:49.448
I'm a friend of Tas.


01:27:52.385 --> 01:27:54.689
- Hi.
- I'm sorry.


01:27:54.722 --> 01:27:56.189
Tasya doesn't live here anymore.


01:27:56.222 --> 01:27:59.525
No, I know. I know, she wanted
me to tell you something.


01:27:59.558 --> 01:28:02.329
- Yeah, maybe some other time.
- Can I come in to talk?


01:28:02.362 --> 01:28:04.297
Get in the fucking house!


01:28:04.331 --> 01:28:06.066
- Please.
- Where is she?


01:28:06.099 --> 01:28:08.168
- She doesn't live here anymore.
- Where is she?


01:28:08.201 --> 01:28:10.737
- I swear I don't know.
- Sit down! Hands on the table!


01:28:10.771 --> 01:28:12.339
Get your hands on the table.


01:28:12.372 --> 01:28:14.774
She travels for work. I don't
think she's in the country.


01:28:14.809 --> 01:28:17.476
Do you recognize me?
Do you know me?


01:28:18.445 --> 01:28:20.046
I need to know.


01:28:20.080 --> 01:28:23.850
I need to know what she's done
to me, do you understand?


01:28:23.884 --> 01:28:26.552
Tell me what this is about.
Maybe I can help.


01:28:30.056 --> 01:28:32.325
Do you ever think of your wife
as a predator?


01:28:32.359 --> 01:28:34.260
Hm, do you ever think of her
that way?


01:28:34.294 --> 01:28:35.862
I don't know.
I don't understand.


01:28:35.895 --> 01:28:38.131
Don't look at me.
Get your head down.


01:28:39.531 --> 01:28:42.969
Do you ever worry about
parasites, like the cat?


01:28:44.404 --> 01:28:46.039
What?


01:28:46.072 --> 01:28:51.444
Just think, one day your wife
is cleaning the cat litter


01:28:51.478 --> 01:28:53.747
and she gets a worm in her,


01:28:53.780 --> 01:28:57.717
and that worm ends up
in her brain.


01:28:57.751 --> 01:29:01.553
The next thing that happens is
she gets an idea in there, too.


01:29:04.324 --> 01:29:07.593
And it's hard to say
whether that idea is really hers


01:29:07.626 --> 01:29:09.462
or it's just the worm.


01:29:09.496 --> 01:29:11.831
And it makes her do
certain things.


01:29:12.932 --> 01:29:14.768
Predator things.


01:29:14.801 --> 01:29:18.405
Eventually, you realize that she
isn't the same person anymore.


01:29:18.438 --> 01:29:21.273
She's not the person
that she used to be.


01:29:22.442 --> 01:29:24.944
It's gotta make you wonder...


01:29:26.612 --> 01:29:29.181
whether you're really
married to her...


01:29:30.382 --> 01:29:32.551
or married to the worm.


01:29:36.823 --> 01:29:39.893
Are you seeing this,
you fucking bitch? I'll do it.


01:29:42.294 --> 01:29:44.329
Come out or I'll do it!


01:29:53.740 --> 01:29:55.708
I'm here. I'm here.


01:29:58.644 --> 01:30:00.979
What are you doing here?


01:30:02.514 --> 01:30:03.917
Tas.


01:30:04.983 --> 01:30:07.921
I've been looking for you.
I wanted to talk.


01:30:09.823 --> 01:30:11.290
Why?


01:30:12.458 --> 01:30:14.861
What have you done to me?


01:30:15.494 --> 01:30:17.196
Done to you?


01:30:19.630 --> 01:30:21.901
You're the one in control.


01:30:22.969 --> 01:30:24.269
No.


01:30:25.771 --> 01:30:28.774
I haven't been in control
of myself lately.


01:30:29.976 --> 01:30:31.210
But you have.


01:30:32.677 --> 01:30:34.146
Where's Ava?


01:30:39.585 --> 01:30:41.720
Where's your lovely girl?


01:30:43.621 --> 01:30:45.324
Can't you remember?


01:30:47.693 --> 01:30:49.962
No, that wasn't me.


01:30:51.497 --> 01:30:53.799
Of course it was.


01:30:58.570 --> 01:31:00.305
Poor Michael.


01:31:02.741 --> 01:31:04.910
I loved him, too.


01:31:10.349 --> 01:31:12.684
But I'm not sure if it was me.


01:31:17.689 --> 01:31:19.291
I'll kill him.


01:31:21.192 --> 01:31:24.363
You fix this
or I swear I'll kill him.


01:31:26.765 --> 01:31:29.601
Go ahead. Do it.


01:31:29.635 --> 01:31:32.203
He's only holding you back.


01:31:38.810 --> 01:31:41.212
This is what
you've always wanted.


01:32:58.322 --> 01:33:00.091
Pull me out.


01:34:33.550 --> 01:34:35.352
Pull me out.


01:36:04.206 --> 01:36:06.744
'Do you need
to take a break?


01:36:06.777 --> 01:36:09.511
'No, let's finish. '


01:36:09.546 --> 01:36:11.079
OK.


01:36:13.148 --> 01:36:15.451
This is my grandfather's pipe.


01:36:16.619 --> 01:36:18.587
He died before I was born.


01:36:20.055 --> 01:36:22.124
My father gave it to me.


01:36:22.860 --> 01:36:24.526
Good.


01:36:25.494 --> 01:36:27.129
Next?


01:36:36.438 --> 01:36:39.141
This is also mine.


01:36:39.174 --> 01:36:43.378
I killed and mounted it one
summer when I was a little girl.


01:36:48.350 --> 01:36:50.018
Very good.

